---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import Badge from '../components/Badge.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About William Mau | Certified Salesforce Administrator"
  description="15+ years in operations and revenue systems. Certified Salesforce Administrator helping small businesses in Schenectady, Albany, and the Capital Region get more from their technology."
>
  <Header />

  <main>
    <Section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-stone-50 to-white dark:from-gray-900 dark:to-gray-950 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Profile Image Placeholder -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start mb-12">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <img src="/william-mau-headshot.jpg" alt="William Mau, Founder of Mau Consulting" class="w-48 h-48 object-cover grayscale rounded-2xl shadow-lg" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
              About Me
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
              Operations and revenue systems leader who ships measurable outcomes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Story -->
        <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Background</h2>
          <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            I'm an operations and revenue systems leader who helps teams eliminate friction and improve execution. My work centers on diagnosing system problems (whether in Salesforce, workflows, or cross-functional processes) and fixing them with measurable results.
          </p>
          <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            I started as a teacher, which taught me how to explain complex concepts clearly and help people learn new systems. That foundation has been invaluable in operations work, where you're constantly translating between technical systems and business outcomes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Over the past decade, I've led revenue operations, enterprise Salesforce implementations, and operational transformations at companies like TalentSmart, Cengage Learning, and Charter Communications. I've eliminated funnel bottlenecks, built executive dashboards, automated workflows, and led infrastructure migrations, all with a focus on pragmatic, sustainable improvements.
          </p>
          <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            I'm a Salesforce Certified Administrator and have a master's degree in History (4.0 GPA). I approach problems methodically: understand the system, identify root causes, design the fix, then document it so it stays fixed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Values -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-6">How I Work</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/20 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                Direct & Outcome-Focused
              </h3>
              <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                No buzzwords. No fluff. I focus on what's broken, why it's broken, and how to fix it with measurable results.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/20 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                Diagnostic-First
              </h3>
              <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                I don't propose solutions before understanding the system. Every project starts with mapping current state and identifying root causes.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/20 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                Security-Minded
              </h3>
              <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                I treat data governance, compliance, and security as non-negotiable. Every change respects your risk posture.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/20 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                Documented & Sustainable
              </h3>
              <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                Every project includes clear documentation so your team can maintain it. No black boxes.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Community Leadership -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-6">Community Leadership</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-stone-900/60 rounded-lg p-6 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">
                  Board of Education
                </h3>
                <Badge variant="accent">Current</Badge>
              </div>
              <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 mb-2">
                Schalmont Central School District, Schenectady, NY
              </p>
              <p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
                I serve on the Board of Education, contributing to strategic decision-making, budgeting oversight, and educational governance. This role combines my operational experience with my commitment to public education.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-stone-900/60 rounded-lg p-6 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">
                  Committee Chair, Scouting America BSA
                </h3>
                <Badge variant="accent">Current</Badge>
              </div>
              <p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 mb-2">
                Schenectady, NY
              </p>
              <p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
                I lead strategic planning, adult leader development, and community engagement initiatives. This work focuses on building sustainable programs and developing leaders.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Personal -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-6">Beyond Work</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
            I'm based in Schenectady, NY with my family. When I'm not working on revenue systems or serving the community, I'm probably building something, reading history, or helping my kids learn how things work.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="bg-navy-900 dark:bg-navy-950 rounded-lg p-8 text-center text-white">
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">
            Let's Work Together
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg mb-6 text-navy-200">
            Whether you're hiring for a full-time role or need consulting help with revenue systems, let's talk about what's stuck and how to fix it.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
            <Button href="/resume" variant="secondary" size="lg">View Resume</Button>
            <Button href="/contact/?source=about" variant="outline" size="lg" class="!border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10">Get In Touch</Button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
